":"你的恩惠和慈爱必追随我一生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要永远住在你的殿中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}